    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Wyrd World is a vast open world for you to explore and conquer solo or with friends. It features:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >character customization - Customize your character with a wide array of personalized options to stand out from the crowd.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Open world exploration that includes multiple biomes (forests, swamps, deserts, and frozen mountain peaks, all surrounded by tropical beaches. Each biome comes with it's own threats and obstacles but rewards the risk in their own unique ways.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A robust crafting system that lets you lean in on your own approach to conquering the island. Build your base anywhere you like on the island. Set up a workshop to maintain your weapons and armor, or just a nice place to relax after returning from the adventure.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Wield a variety of methods to customize your approach to combat and traversal. With over a dozen armor slots to equip, there's a ton of options for building your character out the way you like.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hunt wildlife, endure the elements, explore caves and dungeons, fight monsters, and discover all sorts of treasures if you succeed.</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Wyrd World is a vast open world for you to explore and conquer solo or with friends. It features:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >character customization - Customize your character with a wide array of personalized options to stand out from the crowd.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Open world exploration that includes multiple biomes (forests, swamps, deserts, and frozen mountain peaks, all surrounded by tropical beaches. Each biome comes with it's own threats and obstacles but rewards the risk in their own unique ways.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A robust crafting system that lets you lean in on your own approach to conquering the island. Build your base anywhere you like on the island. Set up a workshop to maintain your weapons and armor, or just a nice place to relax after returning from the adventure.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Wield a variety of methods to customize your approach to combat and traversal. With over a dozen armor slots to equip, there's a ton of options for building your character out the way you like.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hunt wildlife, endure the elements, explore caves and dungeons, fight monsters, and discover all sorts of treasures if you succeed.</p>",
    "short_description": "Open world, multiplayer, survival fantasy setting. Create your custom character, Craft tools, learn spells, loot your enemies. explore through arid deserts, snowy tundras, murky swamps, windy meadows and deep forests. Build a base to stash your rewards or rest from your travels.",
